   271	def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
   272	    """
   273	    Use nearby source-target-template clusters to transform only their local source pixels.
   274	
   275	    Input structure:
   276	    - Black background with several compact clusters and optional unrelated bystanders.
   277	    - Each cluster contains a 4-neighbor source->target legend, a nearby mixed template
   278	      made of teal cells plus one blue marker cell, and one extra source-colored pixel
   279	      2-3 cells away that serves as the execution site for that local legend.
   280	    - The legend's continuation cell after the target touches a teal cell of the template,
   281	      but the true anchor is the blue marker inside that same component.
