   284	    - For each legend, find the touched mixed template, keep only its teal cells as the
   285	      stencil, and treat the blue marker as the alignment anchor.
   286	    - Apply that stencil only to the nearby same-colored execution pixel uniquely paired
   287	      with the legend, recoloring the copied teal cells to the legend's target color.
   288	    - Remove all legend pixels, all mixed-template pixels, and the execution pixels that
   289	      were actually claimed by a local legend.
